.TH "nvme_init_get_features_perf_characteristics" 9 "nvme_init_get_features_perf_characteristics" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_features_perf_characteristics \- Initialize passthru command for Get Features - Performance Characteristics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_features_perf_characteristics
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "enum nvme_get_features_sel sel "  ","
.BI "__u8 attri "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_perf_characteristics *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sel" 12
Select which type of attribute to return,
see \fIenum nvme_get_features_sel\fP
.IP "attri" 12
Attribute Index (ATTRI)
.IP "data" 12
Buffer for returned struct nvme_perf_characteristics
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_PERF_CHARACTERISTICS
